      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你交换给我的雷丘\n现在也活力十足！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604EA463627ED96211768496F74E18000A73B057284E5F6D3B529B53418DB3FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们两个在街头擦身而过，\n互相都觉得对方的雷丘真不错。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
