      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聊起来之后发现，两个人的雷丘都是\n从<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>你那里得到的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "804A8D7767654E4B540E53D173B0FF0C4E244E2A4EBA768496F74E1890FD662F000A4ECE00100002010000004F6090A391CC5F9752307684FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是我们一拍即合，\n两个人萌生了一个梦想，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那就是成为最强的雷丘拍档！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F62114EEC4E0062CD53735408FF0C000A4E244E2A4EBA840C751F4E864E004E2A68A660F3FF0C00100001BE00000A90A35C31662F62104E3A67005F3A768496F74E1862CD6863FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是密阿雷这座城市和你这个人\n给我们俩牵线搭桥的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F5BC6963F96F78FD95EA757CE5E02548C4F608FD94E2A4EBA000A7ED962114EEC4FE972757EBF642D68657684FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "比嘎比嘎比！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD4560E6BD4560E6BD4FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要对所有皮卡丘\n都使用雷之石！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n……只是嘴上说说而已啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189815BF96240670976AE53614E18000A90FD4F7F752896F74E4B77F3FF0100100001BE00000A2026202653EA662F56344E0A8BF48BF4800C5DF25566300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要有雷丘陪着我就很幸福！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
